{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eat, survive, surpass</strong>. In Microbian, you\u2019ll have to rely on your instincts in order to experience the cycle of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will <strong>evolve </strong>and discover new paths, playing as a Microbian that <strong>changes its form and actions</strong>, while consuming all the resources in its way. But\u2026you might not be the only one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in this <strong>artisanal and watercolored</strong> world, while you explore different biomes, discover new and strange creatures, and fight to survive in this cruel place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to evolve?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4116220?t=1774456980","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116220/b8aefec4d7315aa4aa83b1bf5a3629c62afbd03a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774456980","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116220/dafea5a7e74a5c982646e9cbcb26736049c823f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774456980","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116220/dafea5a7e74a5c982646e9cbcb26736049c823f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774456980","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eat, survive, surpass</strong>. In Microbian, you\u2019ll have to rely on your instincts in order to experience the cycle of life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you will <strong>evolve </strong>and discover new paths, playing as a Microbian that <str